sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Root orchestrator
  participant TI as Team inbox/action journals
  participant L as Team lead
  participant WI as Worker journal
  participant W as Worker
  W->>WI: fsync question message
  WI-->>L: replay after wake hint
  alt within delegated authority
    L->>WI: answer/steer + correlation
    WI-->>W: replay and apply
    W->>WI: applied acknowledgement
  else root decision required
    L->>TI: fsync decision_request
    TI-->>R: replay after wake hint
    R->>TI: root action/decision
    TI-->>L: replay and apply
    L->>WI: narrowed worker steer
    WI-->>W: replay and apply
    W->>WI: applied acknowledgement
    L->>TI: team acknowledgement
  end
